      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这个人，很厉害吧。\n比任何人，比任何人都……\n是个，特别努力的人哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6823c80ddc39959a2c1f8e5bfbc7967552051d5fcb4ab160a9b483fb26559d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
