      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵，只要是我能谈的都可以。\n今晚请多关照，气槽同学。\n……顺便问一句，令堂今天也……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9690e8c54fae61153d9c67d5406e5d3e715fe8493340464a290012ad44ddc5c1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
