    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d45b060ecec7a3cd274c1c2f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊，是的，她确实来了……\n但家母有些过于活跃，该说她总是闲不住吗……\n需要我去找找她吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c5b6123123ef799c5025ba7c61d1d9dfb04b2a612ea580ed190694d0a9e5d79",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
