      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊，不用不用！呵呵，原来如此……\n她还是一点都没变呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15cc9e391bc9f92f3c549517d644c577e1f368341842afd2f12f1e8bca15faa5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5a3f7da601410485c4e22d0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以“女帝”闻名的气槽，以及她的母亲。\n除此之外――",
      "source_fingerprint": "7356763a700870b918317da652aea65b4c8821e66d4e8faf1b646ea5d2824e3b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5957847dfa162857ed70e946",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "还有以第一红宝石为首，\n著名的“华丽一族”众人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e38656f10c192b5ecc4c48e75b3799abb4624e5e730385450d612868471b1647",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:464fca36b0ce1d944d2615f5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那些看起来像海外要人的身影大概\n是美妙姿势的相关人士。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b7eee3e7aa20442df8bfac7ebc1d9b1f32ca1c133ad73270f7fdd942be32f3a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cf38b97857b02cbaf1e7b88",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "除此之外，现场还挤满了\n仅仅看见身影，就令人不由得正襟危坐的\n气质高贵的宾客――",
      "source_fingerprint": "36262197f59d16ea088429043ef579c6a2dd45c714ca59f4836f97b547ba23cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cf11f88f8e925e177637223",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不会，您太客气了",
      "source_fingerprint": "45f93f06ca862d367e163a30e1a29d1278c6b35cc59791f4585be2390452d8ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fda787b1308a956d36ca082",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主的母亲",
      "source_fingerprint": "377835c78f9b27c34272eaf82ca537e023d1b1129ff6bbd08c7e798ada6bddd2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62ffc65671be966872f97ef5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊，救世主、训练员！\n对不起，还让你们特意来接我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0c5e8c70d43baf170099bd91ca6cf01850547df5b40bc2d69bfd6f553f9d060",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e450dd3e7b0b8bd6cb6cb87",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，即便是在这样的场合里。\n受到格外瞩目的，果然还是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a71cc20ee3a7ee10d2db4019568ace33d5f3abfb9c5f9f014261a4d6b586ee1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:469b599853dbcf288e924390",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "派对参加者A",
      "source_fingerprint": "37671a847103bb8fb82f6b68e426a94e079af6f4a5cecb0b3bb5ce355f99b11b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d56d447105087d96b10fa359",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "您在『伊丽莎白女王杯』上的胜利，实在精彩\n至极。能见到点亮这个时代的\n秋之女王是我的荣幸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74ec34368c5bcf5addfb246d95ec150cd85cacef5287bb74838a7cc6fc291dff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:413f781e9d05574206b5743d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "派对参加者B",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ce810e206959da12001584a267a14f73081f6461478cddac3e963d63fba8ebd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdfba211cd2a4f2ed6e1881b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "您继承伟大母亲的意志，一路奋力奔跑的身姿……\n令我深受感动。\n还请务必与我详谈一番。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e55e338f8e91438b25e8d87eec969a743827dd75cd54f52eb6dd053d46624da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6daae59ec92d70e083655c2e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b0b4536a8618f87e6f59f3e688bdf6df0281db1545eb55578e92f69875751b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:542266a534069d2ca0a22df1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――这是我的荣幸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "216fcadbd73be7be6db2cd4e9ded7daf3f6519c2c3a9074f1dd144b12c2880f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d2b6e5c401289407851874e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不，这全都是她努力的成果……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca885b52a181ca17764c474ae85f4a7300ec76f48e58ef0576f72df1d590add5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf31da546793f4714bfe4519",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "派对参加者C",
      "source_fingerprint": "56b9e44da8ec3df603499369faec9367a8979cc295f295fe4ce482f59cd19079",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:719e0ea85f28f43c295c550c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "您就是<username>训练员……！\n哎呀，终于见到您了。\n表现完全不像一位新人，实在出色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be2282f3de4ea48e908c2dedc69451df118b057eeb83b3978a074a109487594a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9406abc8439bcf8cc7cd39a0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主与她的母亲，还有我的身边，宾客们\n络绎不绝地来访，想听我们谈谈各种事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e3ae7420ef114bf2d71e9e7211e2bbe9282bd7d670640fcb7ea6ffb34f15446",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:789b6e87eae07b0d8dcb330e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "老实说，我并不习惯这种场合，\n而且宾客们个个气度不凡令我始终惶恐不已――",
      "source_fingerprint": "82ac9166fefe98e267f36496ccbbef27b8848f7c2706c3ad0ec0c9f078d0d9ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd0d187340134ea0a5b5b532",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（救世主……果然很厉害啊）",
      "source_fingerprint": "73a6e4e04e9b7ae0b4ef9be0fbf10116ae844bdf0613be01a71e74415eaaf45d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12b2497f2ec55b0bea73ed7b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b0b4536a8618f87e6f59f3e688bdf6df0281db1545eb55578e92f69875751b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
