      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ca1a37e300a4b0c88bcc517",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――是的，那项战术是训练员的指示。\n――没错。我的确感受到了压力不过――",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5d822d3d78d0d94b1b7430359417199b6194906158ad44195e25c8be7544bd2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f88b47a2bda574d5ea52b765",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的沉稳，果然无人能及。我再次感受到，\n这也正是拥有稳固根基的她独有的强大。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac4d09a99ceff63b23596a4c4d2b9023d16df6095d29c15f7057a29adc1334f4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
